---
const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL || "/").replace(/\/?$/, "/");
---

<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest py-xl border-t border-outline-variant">
  <div class="max-w-page mx-auto px-margin-mobile lg:px-gutter">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-lg mb-12">
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
        <a href={base} class="no-underline hover:no-underline inline-block">
          <img
            src={`${base}images/logo-blog.webp`}
            alt="Promo Gamer"
            class="h-10 w-auto mb-md opacity-80"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md max-w-sm">
          O seu guia definitivo para hardware, periféricos e as melhores promoções do mundo gamer. Análises técnicas feitas por quem joga.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary mb-md uppercase">Institucional</h4>
        <nav class="flex flex-col gap-sm">
          <a href={base} class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-body-md no-underline hover:no-underline">Início</a>
          <a href={`${base}categoria/noticia/`} class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-body-md no-underline hover:no-underline">Notícias</a>
          <a href={`${base}categoria/review/`} class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-body-md no-underline hover:no-underline">Reviews</a>
          <a href={`${base}categoria/guia/`} class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-body-md no-underline hover:no-underline">Guias</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary mb-md uppercase">Siga-nos</h4>
        <div class="flex gap-md">
          <a href={base} class="p-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary hover:text-surface transition-all no-underline" aria-label="Site">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">public</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:?subject=Blog%20Gamer&body={encodeURIComponent(base)}" class="p-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary hover:text-surface transition-all no-underline" aria-label="Email">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
          </a>
          <a href={`${base}rss.xml`} class="p-2 bg-surface-container rounded-lg text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary hover:text-surface transition-all no-underline" aria-label="RSS">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">rss_feed</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-md text-on-surface-variant text-body-md">
      <span>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Promo Gamer. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        Links podem conter afiliados — ao comprar por eles, você apoia o blog sem pagar nada a mais.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
